  "description": "MIRSOZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: H3 O1 1+,C130 H114 Dy6 N6 O34 P9 1-,2(C3 H7 N1 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.460-4.733 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 133.34-135.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [H3O][Dy6(PO4)(AnPO3)8(DMF)6]·2DMF·H2O.",
